{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29232","headline":"秋夕宴李侍御宅 · 许浑","name":"秋夕宴李侍御宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公子徵词客，秋堂递玉杯。\n月高罗幕卷，风度锦屏开。\n凤管添簧品，鵾弦促柱哀。\n转喉云旋合，垂手露徐来。\n烛换三条烬，香销十炷灰。\n蛩声闻鼓歇，萤焰触帘回。\n广槛烟分柳，空庭露积苔。\n解酲须满酌，应爲拨新醅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}